  "slug": "companyforge",
  "name": "Companyforge",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Generates domain-specific AI organizations for Claude Code. Describe a professional domain and CompanyForge builds a working organizational structure — types of work, review workflows, quality checks, and cost management — that you refine through use. The output is a self-contained Claude Code project directory you can drop into any workspace.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `forge` (Use when creating a new domain-specific AI organization — generates lean capability pool, workflows with three-pass review, document…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install companyforge@claude-community` from `aboynamedstacey/companyforge-plugin`.",
